          ["Multiply by A⁻¹", "A − (tr)I + (det)A⁻¹ = O", "A − 7I + 10A⁻¹ = O"],
          ["Rearrange", "A⁻¹ = ((tr)I − A) / det", "A⁻¹ = (7I − A)/10"],
